{"ts": 0.164105, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 127}
{"ts": 0.164525, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.16458, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ1: What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 76}
