{"ts": 0.16463, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 41}
{"ts": 0.171694, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m✓\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.171744, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ2: What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 73}
