{"ts": 0.178503, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[96mQ3: Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92myour answer:\u001b[0m ", "len": 104}
